The sample is a 64-bit Windows GUI PE file, with an entry point matching the radare2 disassembly at 0x1400084b8. The high entropy value (45) and presence of a high-entropy overlay indicate embedded or encrypted content, which is a tampering signal for a legitimate Microsoft binary (source: malcat file_summary).

